<sect1 id="app-pgreceivexlog" xreflabel="pg_receivexlog">
  <title><command>pg_receivexlog</command> 已重命名为 <command>pg_receivewal</command></title>

   <indexterm>
     <primary>pg_receivexlog</primary>
     <see>pg_receivewal</see>
   </indexterm>

   <para>
    PostgreSQL 9.6 及更低版本提供了一个名为
    <command>pg_receivexlog</command>
    <indexterm><primary>pg_receivexlog</primary></indexterm>
    的命令来获取预写式日志（WAL）文件。该命令已重命名为 <command>pg_receivewal</command>，有关 <command>pg_receivewal</command> 的文档请参见
    <xref linkend="app-pgreceivewal"/>，有关此更改的详细信息请参见
    <link linkend="release-prior">PostgreSQL 10 的发行说明</link>。
   </para>

</sect1>
